# plugin-update-checker IS vendored and tracked, so a downloaded release auto-updates
# out of the box. Anything else dropped into lib/ stays untracked.
lib/*
!lib/plugin-update-checker/

# Build output
*.zip

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Never commit anything site-specific
*.local.md
.env
